---
import DocsSwitcher from "../../components/DocsSwitcher.astro";
import DocsTabs from "../../components/DocsTabs.astro";
import SiteLayout from "../../layouts/SiteLayout.astro";
---

<SiteLayout title="Psi Reference | Productive Superintelligence" layout="docs">
    <DocsSwitcher current="psi" />
    <DocsTabs current="reference" />

    <section class="page-section" aria-labelledby="reference-title">
        <p class="label">Reference</p>
        <h1 id="reference-title">Psi surface map.</h1>
        <hr />
        <p class="section-copy">
            The PSI tools share package refs and service-shaped resources, but
            each project owns a narrow public boundary.
        </p>

        <div class="page-list">
            <a href="/docs/cli">
                <span class="item-title">PsiCLI</span>
                <span class="item-copy"><code>psi init</code>, <code>psi inspect</code>, and <code>psi launch</code> for local users and scripts.</span>
            </a>
            <a href="/docs/hub">
                <span class="item-title">PsiHub</span>
                <span class="item-copy">Python APIs for package metadata, validation, local hub storage, cards, config templates, and local hub apps.</span>
            </a>
            <a href="https://lllm.one/reference/protocol/">
                <span class="item-title">Low-Level Language Models (LLLM)</span>
                <span class="item-copy">Tactic protocol, service adapters, runtimes, remote clients, and PsiHub metadata helpers.</span>
            </a>
            <a href="https://sssn.one/reference/python-api/">
                <span class="item-title">Simple System of Systems Network (SSSN)</span>
                <span class="item-copy">Channel, event, artifact, snapshot, store, server, client, and resolver APIs.</span>
            </a>
            <a href="https://aaax.one/reference/python-api/">
                <span class="item-title">Advanced Autonomous Agent Executor (AAAX)</span>
                <span class="item-copy">Strategy, mounted resources, package serving, shell endpoints, and handoff surfaces.</span>
            </a>
        </div>
    </section>
</SiteLayout>
